Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: amlogic: describe T7 boot display handoff

Describe the disjoint VDIN/display resources, fixed RGB888 boot contract
and firmware-owned HDMI PLL provider. Preserve the capture-only and normal
modesetting profiles.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
