 .../bindings/media/amlogic,t7-vdin-test.yaml  | 16 +++--
 MAINTAINERS                                   |  6 ++
 5 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/amlogic,t7-display-handoff.yaml

